---
source: crates/ccusage-cli-parser/src/tests.rs
expression: "help_text_for_args(&[\"ccusage\".to_string(), \"dsh\".to_string()])"
---
Usage reports for DSH.

USAGE:
  ccusage dsh <COMMANDS>

COMMANDS:
  daily       Show DSH usage grouped by date
  weekly      Show DSH usage grouped by week
  monthly     Show DSH usage grouped by month
  session     Show DSH usage grouped by session

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  ccusage dsh daily --help
  ccusage dsh weekly --help
  ccusage dsh monthly --help
  ccusage dsh session --help
